# Kotlin/Wasm + Kotlin/JS yarn lock, generated by the Kotlin Gradle plugin's Node.js toolchain.
# Kotlin recommends committing it for reproducible JS-toolchain dependency resolution, but this
# repo's only wasmJs CI job (deploy-web.yml) runs *after* merge to main, so a lock mismatch
# between a contributor's machine and the Linux runner would surface too late to catch in review.
# Revisit once Phase 5 adds a wasmJs build/test job to pr-checks.yml (see MIGRATION_PLAN.md).
kotlin-js-store/
